      "content": "For our pancreatic cancer cohort of 75 patients I have a mutation matrix (patients by genes), exon sizes, a cancer gene list and a GMT pathway file. Please use SAMBAR to cluster the patients into subgroups with its default range of cluster numbers."
    },
